# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Meta-Pro frontend environment (Vite)
# Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides. For production, set these in
# Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL of the deployed FastAPI backend (Render).
# When set, every fetch / SSE request is sent to this absolute URL instead of
# the local `/api` Vite dev proxy (see frontend/vite.config.ts). Without it,
# production builds call `/api/...` on the Vercel domain, which 404s.
# Replace with your actual Render service URL:
#   https://<service-name>.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://meta-pro-backend.onrender.com
